//
// Bytewise correctness for GEMM rn1 pair ELFs (Phase C step A).
//
// For each shape in conv/build_pair_rn1._RN1_PAIRS, dispatches the
// pair ELF (one shared input BO, two independent weight/output args via
// chain_links) and compares each per-sub output against the x1 single-
// kernel ELF run twice with the same weights. PASS = bytewise identical.
//
// Both the pair ELF and its x1 counterpart are built on demand into
// MDV6_BUILD_DIR/build_merged/.
//
// REQUIRES: ryzen_ai_npu2, peano, torch
//
// RUN: rm -rf test_stx
// RUN: mkdir -p test_stx
// RUN: cd test_stx
//
// RUN: env MDV6_BUILD_DIR=. %run_on_npu2% python3 %S/conv/test_pair.py --shape all
